<title>UK: Dixons Group strengthens directors' board.</title>
<headline>Dixons Group strengthens directors' board.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British electronics retailer Dixons Group Plc said on Monday that it had strengthened its board by promoting three senior managers to it.</p>
<p>Dixons said it was promoting David Gilbert, the current managing director of Currys and also David Hamid, the managing director of Dixons Group Commercial Services.</p>
<p>The third new director would be Ian Livingston who becomes Finance and Systems Director.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
